Depth calculation: watch out for overflow with large sizes; use repeated division in uint64:

```c
static int tree_depth(off_t size) {
    uint64_t blocks = (size + TREEPAGESIZE - 1) / TREEPAGESIZE;
    int depth = 0;
    uint64_t capacity = TREEDIRSIZE; // files at depth 0
    while (capacity < blocks) { depth++; capacity *= TREEDIRSIZE; }
    return depth;
}
```
